      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T13:52:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: does this create a window of opportunity for apps to receive traffic between the time when the old ranges are removed and the time when new ranges are added? If so, might want to add a TODO to fix that. Or, if we already have an \"UID range diff\" function somwehere that will calculate the removed and added deltas for us, we could use that.",
